pan></p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoToc1>Bibliography<span=20style=3D"mso-tab-count:=
1=20dotted">.=20</span><span=20style=3D"mso-element:field-begin"></span>=20=
PAGEREF=20_45a166c8-90d8-a43b-41a9-f065acd2f1bf=20\h=20<span=20style=3D"mso=
-element:field-separator"></span><span=20style=3D"mso-element:field-end"></=
span></p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"mso-speci=
al-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20class=3D=
ForewordTitle>Foreword</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>ISO=20(the=20Intern=
ational=20Organization=20for=20Standardization)=20is=20a=20worldwide=20fede=
ration=20of=20national=20standards=20bodies=20(ISO=20member=20bodies).=20Th=
e=20work=20of=20preparing=20International=20Standards=20is=20normally=20car=
ried=20out=20through=20ISO=20technical=20committees.=20Each=20member=20body=
=20interested=20in=20a=20subject=20for=20which=20a=20technical=20committee=20=
has=20been=20established=20has=20the=20right=20to=20be=20represented=20on=20=
that=20committee.=20International=20organizations,=20governmental=20and=20n=
on-governmental,=20in=20liaison=20with=20ISO,=20also=20take=20part=20in=20t=
he=20work.=20ISO=20collaborates=20closely=20with=20the=20International=20El=
ectrotechnical=20Commission=20(IEC)=20on=20all=20matters=20of=20electrotech=
nical=20standardization.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>The=20procedures=20=
used=20to=20develop=20this=20document=20and=20those=20intended=20for=20its=20=
further=20maintenance=20are=20described=20in=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Directives,=20=
Part=201.=20In=20particular,=20the=20different=20approval=20criteria=20need=
ed=20for=20the=20different=20types=20of=20ISO=20documents=20should=20be=20n=
oted.=20This=20document=20was=20drafted=20in=20accordance=20with=20the=20ed=
itorial=20rules=20of=20the=20ISO/IEC=20Directives,=20Part=202=20(see=20www.=
iso.org/directives).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Attention=20is=20drawn=
=20to=20the=20possibility=20that=20some=20of=20the=20elements=20of=20this=20=
document=20may=20be=20the=20subject=20of=20patent=20rights.=20ISO=20shall=20=
not=20be=20held=20responsible=20for=20identifying=20any=20or=20all=20such=20=
patent=20rights.=20Details=20of=20any=20patent=20rights=20identified=20duri=
ng=20the=20development=20of=20the=20document=20will=20be=20in=20the=20Intro=
duction=20and/or=20on=20the=20ISO=20list=20of=20patent=20declarations=20rec=
eived=20(see=20www.iso.org/patents).</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>Any=20=
trade=20name=20used=20in=20this=20document=20is=20information=20given=20for=
=20the=20convenience=20of=20users=20and=20does=20not=20constitute=20an=20en=
dorsement.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>For=20an=20explanation=20of=20th=
e=20voluntary=20nature=20of=20standards,=20the=20meaning=20of=20ISO=20speci=
fic=20terms=20and=20expressions=20related=20to=20conformity=20assessment,=20=
as=20well=20as=20information=20about=20ISO=E2=80=99s=20adherence=20to=20the=
=20World=20Trade=20Organization=20(WTO)=20principles=20in=20the=20Technical=
=20Barriers=20to=20Trade=20(TBT),=20see=20www.iso.org/iso/foreword.html.</p=
>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordText>This=20document=20was=20prepared=20by=20Techn=
ical=20Committee=20ISO/TC=2092,=20<i>Fire=20safety</i>.</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
ForewordText>A=20list=20of=20all=20parts=20in=20the=20ISO=2017755=20series=20=
can=20be=20found=20on=20the=20ISO=20website.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DForewordTex=
t>Any=20feedback=20or=20questions=20on=20this=20document=20should=20be=20di=
rected=20to=20the=20user=E2=80=99s=20national=20standards=20body.=20A=20com=
plete=20listing=20of=20these=20bodies=20can=20be=20found=20at=20www.iso.org=
/members.html.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><br=20clear=3D"all"=20style=3D"=
mso-special-character:line-break;page-break-before:always"=20/></p>=0A<h1=20=
class=3DIntroTitle>Introduction</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><a=20href=3D"=
#isotr17755">ISO/TR=C2=A017755:2014</a>=20has=20shown=20that=20experts=20in=
volved=20in=20fire=20safety=20who=20work=20on=20international=20and=20natio=
nal=20fire=20statistics=20databases=20face=20three=20main=20issues:</p>=0A<=
p=20class=3DMsoNormal>a=20lack=20of=20common=20terminology=20(many=20terms=20=
have=20different=20definitions),</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>a=20lack=20of=
=20common=20methodology,</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>some=20weaknesses=20i=
n=20the=20training=20and=20qualification=20of=20fire=20investigators.</p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>=E2=80=A6=E2=80=8B</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal><o:p=
>&nbsp;</o:p></p>=0A=0A</div>=0A=0A<br=20clear=3D"all"=20class=3D"section"=20=
/>=0A=0A<div=20class=3D>=0A=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitle1>Fire=20safety=20=E2=80=
=94=20Statistical=20data=20collection</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMainTitle2>Part=C2=
=A02:=20Vocabulary</p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Scope</h1>=0A<p=20class=3D=
MsoNormal>Data=20collection=20is=20of=20prime=20importance=20in=20fire=20sa=
fety,=20for=20several=20reasons:=20assessing=20the=20effect=20of=20any=20re=
gulation,=20providing=20probability=20and=20gravity=20data=20to=20fire=20ri=
sk=20analysis,=20and=20the=20selection=20of=20scenarios=20for=20examples=20=
in=20fire=20safety=20engineering.=20Statistical=20data=20collection=20of=20=
fires=20is=20nevertheless=20collected=20and=20analysed=20from=20local=20or=20=
national=20perspectives=20at=20the=20time=20of=20publication=20of=20this=20=
document,=20making=20any=20comparison=20difficult.=20A=20first=20step=20ide=
ntified=20in=20the=20need=20for=20harmonization=20is=20the=20issue=20of=20t=
erminology.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>This=20document=20defines=20termin=
ology=20relating=20to=20fire=20statistical=20data,=20in=20order=20to=20supp=
lement=20ISO=2013943=20for=20this=20specific=20field=20of=20application.</p=
>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Normative=20references</h1>=0A<p=20class=3DMs=
oNormal>There=20are=20no=20normative=20references=20in=20this=20document.</=
p>=0A<h1=20class=3DMsoHeading1>Terms=20and=20definitions</h1>=0A<p=20class=3D=
MsoNormal>For=20the=20purposes=20of=20this=20document,=20the=20following=20=
terms=20and=20definitions=20apply.</p>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>ISO=20and=20=
IEC=20maintain=20terminology=20databases=20for=20use=20in=20standardization=
=20at=20the=20following=20addresses:</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListContinue1>ISO=20=
Online=20browsing=20platform:=20available=20at=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DListCo=
ntinue1>IEC=20Electropedia:=20available=20at=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>=
3.1</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>accelerant</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinitio=
n>=20or=20oxidizer,=20often=20an=20ignitable=20liquid,=20solid=20or=20gas=20=
(LGP/NP)=20intentionally=20used=20to=20initiate=20a=20fire=20or=20increase=20=
the=20rate=20of=20growth=20or=20spread=20of=20fire</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermN=
um>3.2</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>area=20of=20origin=20of=20the=20fire</b>=
</p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>general=20localized=20area=20within=20the=20=
location=20where=20the=20fire=20started</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20=
to=20entry:=20See=20also,=20location=20of=20the=20fire=20(3.58)=20and=20poi=
nt=20of=20origin=20of=20the=20fire=20(3.64).=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>=
3.3</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>fuel</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>&lt;=
fire=20statistics&gt;=20material=20that=20maintains=20combustion=20under=20=
specified=20environmental=20conditions</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20t=
o=20entry:=20This=20definition=20differs=20from=20that=20given=20in=20<a=20=
href=3D"#iso13943">ISO=C2=A013943:2017,=203.189</a>.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3D=
TermNum>3.4</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>location=20of=20the=20fire</b></p>=0A=
<p=20class=3DDefinition>general=20area=20where=20the=20origin=20of=20the=20=
fire=20started</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20to=20entry:=20See=20also,=
=20,=20and=20.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.5</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><=
b>point=20of=20origin=20of=20the=20fire</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>e=
xact=20physical=20location=20within=20the=20area=20of=20origin=20where=20th=
e=20fire=20starts</p>=0A<p=20class=3DNote>Note=201=20to=20entry:=20See=20al=
so,=20,=20and=20.=20</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.6</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerm=
s><b>self-immolation</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermsAdmitted>suicide=20fire</p=
>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>act=20of=20killing=20oneself=20by=20the=20use=20=
of=20fire,=20often=20by=20pouring=20=20over=20the=20body=20and=20igniting=20=
it</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.7</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTerms><b>husked=20rice=
</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermsAdmitted>DEPRECATED:=20cargo=20rice</p>=0A<p=20=
class=3DDefinition>paddy=20from=20which=20the=20husk=20only=20has=20been=20=
removed</p>=0A<p=20class=3DSource>[SOURCE:=20<a=20href=3D"#ISO7301">ISO=C2=A0=
7301:2011,=203.2</a>,=20modified=20=E2=80=94=20The=20term=20=E2=80=9Ccargo=20=
rice=E2=80=9D=20is=20shown=20as=20deprecated,=20and=20Note=201=20to=20entry=
=20is=20not=20included=20here]</p>=0A<p=20class=3DTermNum>3.8</p>=0A<p=20cl=
ass=3DTerms><b>gelatinization=20time</b></p>=0A<p=20class=3DDefinition>=20t=
ime=20necessary=20for=2090=20%=20of=20the=20kernels=20to=20pass=20from=20th=
eir=20natural=20state=20to=20the=20gel=20state</p>=0A<p=20class=3DSource>[S=
OURCE:=20<a=20href=3D"#ISO14864">ISO=C2=A014864:1998,=203.1</a>]</p>=0A<h1=20=
class=3DMsoHeading1>Main=20content</h1>=0A<h2=20class=3DMsoHeading2>General=
</h2>=0A<p=20class=3DMsoNormal>Here=E2=80=99s=20where=20you=20place=20your=20=
main=20content.</p>=0A<h2=20class=3DMsoHeading2>Data=20models</h2>=0A<p=20c=
lass=3DMsoNormal>The=20following=20data=20models=20are=20used=20by=20other=20=
data=20models=20specified=20in=20this=20document.</p>=0A<h3=20class=3DMsoHe=
ading3>Basic=20data=20types</h3>=0A<p=20class=3DFigureGraphic><img=20src=3D=
